      "text": "PHASE 3: JOUST-DOMINATED TOURNAMENT (14th-16th c.)\n  +------------------------------------------+\n  | INDIVIDUAL JOUST TAKES OVER              |\n  | -- Tilt barrier introduced ~13th c.      |\n  | -- Separates horses, reduces collision   |\n  | -- Pageantry dominates content           |\n  | -- Elaborate costumes, theatrical themes |\n  | -- \"pas d'armes\" (passage of arms):      |\n  |    challenger holds a \"passage\" vs all   |\n  | -- Declining military relevance          |\n  +------------------------------------------+\n```"
