      "text": "**Tournament economics** (William Marshal's career model):\n```\nTOURNAMENT INCOME MODEL:\n  Knight captured = captive can be ransomed\n    -- Ransom value: horse + armor + additional sum\n    -- Horse value: 2-3 years of peasant income\n    -- Armor (full harness): 5-10 years peasant income\n    -- Skilled knight could earn modern equivalent of\n       hundreds of thousands per year in active tourney years"
